  "releaseNotes": "v4.0.0 (2026-06-26):\n\n      Updated\n      - **Portamical.Core dependency updated to v4.0.0**\n      - Maintains compatibility with latest Portamical.Core features and improvements\n\n      Improved\n      - **Complete test coverage for assertion infrastructure**\n        - Fatal exception filtering (`IsNotFatal`) - 8 new tests covering all branches\n        - Sync wrapper lambda execution - Fixed `ThrowsDetails` to properly invoke wrapped attempt\n        - Equality assertions - Added BigInteger, custom type fallback, and non-interned string tests\n        - NaN handling - Complete branch coverage for double/float special value comparisons\n      - **Enhanced documentation**\n        - Added comprehensive XML documentation for `ThreadSafeSync(Func<Task>)` overload\n        - Includes usage examples, performance notes, and thread safety guidance\n\n      Fixed\n      - **`ThrowsDetails` sync wrapper** - Now properly uses wrapped lambda instead of calling original action twice\n        - Lines 610-617: `catchExceptionAsync` now invokes `attemptAsync` parameter correctly\n        - Test updated: `ThrowsDetails_catchExceptionInvoked_receivesWrappedAttempt`\n\n      Test Coverage\n      - **189 total tests** (up from 183)\n      - 6 new tests for fatal exception branches\n      - 5 new tests for equality edge cases (BigInteger, custom types, non-interned strings)\n      - 1 new test for NaN special value handling\n      - All tests passing with zero regressions",
